	To anyone interested, tosmabru is a carryover from Institute Loglan.   
It
was a made up (but otherwise legal) word, to show that a word made in  
this
fashion would break up into to smabru (two smokers[smoke breathers])).
Slinkui comes from the same source. If permitted, paslinkui  
(past-linear-kin = ancestors)
would become illegal.  Ultimately we allowed slinkui words by requiring  
paslinkui words
to be hyphenated as pasylinkui.

